/**
 * FAB1 layout, generated by blender/fab_twin_scripts/build_fab1.py from fab_layout.py: edit the
 * Python source and regenerate, not this file. Blender building frame (x east, y north, metres);
 * x / y is the template origin (the centre of the unit's front face), rot its turn in degrees.
 */
